<title>USA: Katz Media Group to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Katz Media Group to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Katz Media Group Inc said on Thursday it will repurchase up to 2 million common-stock shares, to be held as treasury stock and for general corporate purchases.</p>
<p>The shares will be bought on the open market or in negotiated purchases.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
